@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
left to right direction
class MissionLog
class Mission {
  - rover : Rover
  - history : ArrayList<MissionStep>
  - returned : boolean
}
class Rover
class MissionStep
MissionLog ..> Mission
MissionLog ..> Rover
MissionLog ..> MissionStep
Mission --> "1" Rover : rover
Mission --> "0..*" MissionStep : history
note bottom of Mission
  責任視角：省略非重點成員
  每次執行使用新的Mission
end note
@enduml
